WEBVTT

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:05.160
That weapon has the power to destroy
the balance of the world

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.580
and lead it down the path
of its own destruction.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.000
Just as Bahamut!

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.620
Hug me.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:16.420
I would like to go to the land of the gods.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.470
Yeah, the old lady back in my village
would talk about it all the time.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.970
Then let us go to your village.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.230
Your Highness.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.860
We have not yet ascertained the whereabouts

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.360
of the fugitives Jeanne D'Arc,
Favaro Leone and Nina Drango.

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:27.570
There have been multiple eyewitness accounts.
It is the same regarding the mysterious child.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.620
We are interrogating Kaisar Lidfard harshly,

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.540
but he has maintained his silence.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.330
As expected of the Orleans Knight captain.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.770
I see you were not ready for your job.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:59.270
-I will leave the fugitives to you.
-Yes, My Lord.

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:03.610
I will be heading to Eibos.

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:18.830
Rage of Bahamut

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.840
They are the same
and lose themselves

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:30.090
Cuz there are lots of roads to go
And the path suddenly seems rougher

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:35.520
I wanna walk straight ahead
Knock down another dream

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:41.060
Most broke before they ever came true

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:45.110
But walk this way

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.200
Get out of my way

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:58.210
Depends on the way you think it
To a yielding heart

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:02.880
the future, hope,
despair and worry all look all the same

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:09.180
So much that you'll turn down the truth
that lied to you that day

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:13.890
when you were prepared for it all.
You go your way, don't you?

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:18.350
But walk this way

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:23.440
Get out of my way

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.490
But walk this way

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.650
Get up! You have a visitor.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.610
Dias!

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:15.780
It seems that I'm a real jailbird now.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.910
An iron sword would suit you more than these iron bars.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.420
How are the knights?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.050
I suppose not much can be expected
when their captain is imprisoned.

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:37.930
Dias, I leave the Orleans Knights in your hands.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.310
You are the captain!

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.690
I met Jeanne.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.480
Jeanne?

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:52.950
She hadn't changed.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.740
The Orleans Knights will rise again.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.450
Jeanne is our salvation.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:05.630
Yes. The three of us will return the knights to glory.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:34.400
I see it! My house is right over there!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.340
Hey!

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.390
I'm home!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.940
-Nina!
-Nina!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.910
Ow! Hey, you mean Sis, not Nina!

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:24.410
-Nina! How have you been?
-Nina's back!

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:31.290
Hey, it's Peep-Peep! This is a mora-
it's name's Peep-Peep!

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.920
Why Peep-Peep?

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:37.720
I don't know. But it's cute, isn't it?

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.260
Is that you, Nina!

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:44.810
-I'm home!
-I'm so glad you're home.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.270
I am...

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.600
This is my friend, Jeanne.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:57.030
So that's what they're wearing
in the capital nowadays.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.120
Welcome back, Nina!

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:09.750
Thanks!

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.170
Welcome home, Nina!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.380
Thanks!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:14.800
-Welcome back, Nina!
-Thanks!

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.590
Nina, welcome back!

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.430
Thanks!

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.370
Jeanne, hurry up!

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:47.120
I'm going to leave you behind!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.860
I'm back, Granny!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.910
This is our village elder.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.790
What's wrong?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.210
I am Jeanne D'Arc.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.210
She's not a statue.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:45.510
Nina! You've gotten thin.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.100
What happened?

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.140
You know, this and that.

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:50.640
Anyway, Granny,

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:55.860
my friend Jeanne is begging
to get to the land of the gods.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:58.900
Now, I know you've been there before, Granny.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.530
Could you tell us how you got there?

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.370
Please, Granny!

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.640
Wanna sip?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.720
-No, thank you.
-No, thank you.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:43.610
Two thousand years ago,
the gods and demons worked together

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.030
to take down Bahamut.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.740
And so I took the tired gods

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:53.620
and carried them to their homeland on my back.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.080
Yeah! I love this story!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.580
Look at that.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.340
That's what I looked like back then.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:07.380
Pretty cool, right? I was a looker!

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.930
Granny, are you all right?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.810
There' s no way you could fit
everyone on your little back.

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:15.270
-Pshaw!
-Oh, she's mad!

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.350
Hey, Nina!

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:24.070
I must go to the land of the gods.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.030
I implore your help.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.820
Sorry, Granny!

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.030
I implore you!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.620
-Granny!
-I implore you!

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:33.290
Granny?

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:41.290
She fell asleep.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.760
You can't wake her up once she falls asleep.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:47.170
Let's just come back tomorrow.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:59.270
This is wonderful.

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.770
The water's amazing.

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:04.980
It even has healing powers.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:15.580
Hey, Jeanne, is Mugaro's dad cool?

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:20.080
I mean, he has to be.
You've got it down, Jeanne.

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.500
I did not view that gentleman in such a way.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:29.050
That gentleman? You're so dirty!

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:33.010
What was between us was not romantic.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:37.600
What? But they say that children are the fruit of love.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:45.230
I know he is still watching over El and me.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.650
That is everything.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.950
What about you?

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:51.990
What? Me?

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.830
Has a man captured your heart?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.200
Yes.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:04.500
Since I transform into a dragon
when I get near a handsome man,

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:08.010
I've never really been able
to get close to anyone like that.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:12.430
But he's the only one I've been able to dance with.

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:15.050
I felt safe when I was with him.

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:17.810
I was really happy.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:25.520
It almost felt like I was born to dance with him.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:27.860
Is this your first love?

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:32.110
Yeah. Maybe.

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:35.490
That is wonderful.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:38.240
What was your first love like?

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:41.620
I don't know.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.460
I received my divine revelation before I knew romance

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.880
and charged into battle as a servant of the gods.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.630
Are the gods' servants not allowed to love?

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:57.640
I hope you will find happiness with that person.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:07.560
Well, the thing is, the person I fell for

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:10.440
turned out to be someone I hated.

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:14.780
So I have no idea what I should do.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:19.950
He's really a great guy,
but he's done a lot of horrible things.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.750
But you still like him?

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.670
I don't know.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.050
I still can't bring myself to hate him.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:47.270
I too have many different faces.

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:53.490
It is not strange that the man you like
would have contradictions.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.030
Really?

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:02.290
If you are able to embrace
those contradictions too,

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.250
then your love may be real.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.270
Hey, you guys!

00:14:34.230 --> 00:14:35.940
Dinnertime!

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:38.450
Coming!

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:46.210
Jeanne, that looks so good on you!

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.460
Really?

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.960
Looking real good!

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.590
Time to eat!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.020
How long can you stay, Nina?

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:10.020
We'll be taking a trip to the land of the gods tomorrow.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:13.570
-Land of the gods? I'll go too!
-Me too!

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:16.240
You can't come! It's not that simple.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.700
Why are you going to the land of the gods?

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:21.700
-To go see Mugaro.
-Mugaro?

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.330
Who's that?

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:29.920
Mugaro is Jeanne's holy child,
and he's been separated from her.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.880
Holy child?

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.170
I don't get it.

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:35.250
-I get it though.
-Liar.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.130
-I'm not lying!
-Then who is it?

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:40.590
-The holy child is the holy child!
-So who is that holy child, then?

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:24.090
Can't sleep?

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:26.050
There's water over there.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.560
Thank you.

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:32.560
We can talk if you'd like.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.060
Thank you.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.650
It's a strange village, isn't it?

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:43.860
Yes.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:47.330
I was really overwhelmed at first too.

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:50.660
Oh, I'm not dragonfolk.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:54.120
I'm from a nearby village, and I married in.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.840
Nina is a wonderful child.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.630
Thank you.

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:11.430
Those are pictures of the parents
of the children we take care of.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:17.060
The village is poor,
so they are all out earning money for everyone.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.940
Even Nina's father?

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:22.900
Her father died.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:29.410
He wanted to protect the village
from the fireball 10 years ago.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:41.130
Did Nina cause any trouble for you
turning into a dragon or anything?

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:44.550
No, she saved my life.

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:49.260
Really? She's growing up, isn't she?

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:55.270
Ever since her father died,
whenever she gets near a man like him,

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:58.730
she'll turn into a dragon and go on a bit of a rampage.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:03.190
Almost as if to avoid painful memories.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.200
Thank you, Jeanne.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:13.580
Thank you for being her friend.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:18.380
Please don't. I am not a person
who deserves to be thanked.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:23.170
I am... I am the one who...

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.550
It must have been hard.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:32.600
I can tell from how attached she is.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.480
I can tell how kind you've been to her.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.400
So thank you.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.830
You've been through so much.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:15.180
See? I told you to stop.

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:18.480
Cerby, I need you to say it again for me.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.940
-What?
-Do it!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:23.110
You're the captain now.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.940
-Louder!
-You're the captain now!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:29.990
I'll make you the captain's wife!

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.910
What?

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.500
Get it together, Captain.

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.960
I thought you'd be here.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:45.340
Oh, hey there, Vice Captain!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:48.880
You are an Orleans Knight!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:54.350
What's the big idea?

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.810
What are you getting mad for?

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.230
-Cerby!
-Please come back soon!

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:09.780
Did you get enough sleep? I sure did.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:11.450
I bet.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.070
Are you two serious about going?

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:17.370
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:24.420
Yes!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.250
So how do we get there?

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:30.380
I told you! I'll carry you on my back.

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:34.300
What? But your back won't-

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:56.450
Mom, I'm off, then!

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.830
Have a safe trip!

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:00.370
Nina.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.000
Bring back souvenirs.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.750
I'll bring home an angel.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:07.630
Jeanne.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.590
Take good care of Nina for me.

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:14.590
I will.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.100
I'm off, then!

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:27.650
-Nina! Bye!
-Be careful!

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:30.400
Make sure you protect Jeanne!

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:32.030
Okay, I will!

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:34.860
Bye! Have a safe trip!

00:21:53.630 --> 00:22:01.100
As horrible as you are
I can't help but love you

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:08.900
Even while I waited
That is all I felt

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:17.110
Ephemeral lovers, both flawed and missing pieces
We have finally become one

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:24.500
in this miniature garden at the edge of sorrow
Can you hear my heart speaking?

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:32.750
Ah, I may no longer feel
that I want to go back in time

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:40.350
But there are feelings, feelings, feelings
I can only feel now

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:48.400
I want to run away with you,
dancing just like in a fairy tale

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:56.360
Don't tell me it will only be this once, darling
I am on the same ark

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:00.780
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:05.330
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:08.750
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:12.920
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:13.880
Yeah

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:37.150
How much longer will it hold?

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:40.610
We exceeded the limits long ago.

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:49.160
Jeanne!
What can you cook best?

00:23:49.330 --> 00:23:52.880
- Why all of a sudden? Cook best?
- Uh ye- yes!

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:56.760
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "City of the Gods: Part 1"

00:23:56.880 --> 00:23:59.170
- Cook best...?
- What? What's wrong?

00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:01.220
- Soup made into stew!
- That's just soup!

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.970
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:08.350
Baha Baha Baha Soul!

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:10.940
I'm counting on you to watch next time.
